# Every slide on the lab ledge (0.45 m, 0.5 m wide, angle-iron edges), 25 degrees off square, drifting toward the toe side: the
# slides with the ledge top on the far side (the boardslide's far truck rests on it, the bluntslide's
# back wheels hook over onto it). Same switches as lab-slide-table. Review: scenarios/slides.strips.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 5.5 -2.6 0.14 25
hold up 6..80
hold ollie 70..90
tap grind 128
tap grind+up 150
tap grind+down 172
tap grind 194
tap grind+down+left 216
tap grind+up+left 238
tap grind 260
bot balance
run 500
expect event grindStart{trick=BS Boardslide,slide=true} within 120..140
expect event grindStart{trick=BS Noseslide,slide=true} within 151..152
expect event grindStart{trick=BS Tailslide,slide=true} within 173..174
expect event grindStart{trick=BS Bluntslide,slide=true} within 217..218
expect event grindStart{trick=BS Nosebluntslide,slide=true} within 239..240
expect no event bail
